# Removing the SDK

The language generator packs no longer depend on `@deterministic-code/generator-sdk` or a vendored SDK copy. That SDK is being deleted.

When changing a generator:

- Do not import from `@deterministic-code/generator-sdk`.
- Inline or relocate only what that generator actually uses into pack-owned modules.
- Fix one generator at a time. Goal for each file: **zero SDK imports**.
- Start with `generate-backend-app`, then the rest of the generate entrypoints.
